#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1015
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_WeShortenItToDevon"
msgid ""
"The DEVON CORPORATION…\n"
"We all just shorten it to DEVON.\p"
"That company makes all sorts of\n"
"convenient products.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1021
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_SneakyLookingManWentAroundCorner"
msgid ""
"Hm? A sneaky-looking man?\p"
"Come to think of it, yes, a shady-\n"
"looking guy went around the corner.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1026
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_HaveYouChallengedGym"
msgid ""
"Have you taken the POKéMON GYM\n"
"challenge?\p"
"When you get that shiny GYM BADGE\n"
"in hand, I guess TRAINERS begin to\l"
"realize what is required of them.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1033
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_HeyThatsRustborosGymBadge"
msgid ""
"Hey, that's RUSTBORO's GYM BADGE!\p"
"Out of all the POKéMON GYM BADGES,\n"
"RUSTBORO's is the coolest, I'd say.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1038
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_YoureNewAroundHere"
msgid ""
"Oh? Who might you be?\n"
"You're a new face around these parts.\p"
"Have you just transferred into the\n"
"POKéMON TRAINER'S SCHOOL?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1044
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_GymLeaderIsntEasyWithFire"
msgid ""
"I challenged the GYM LEADER, but…\p"
"It's not going to be easy winning with\n"
"my FIRE-type POKéMON…\p"
"FIRE-type POKéMON don't match up\n"
"well against ROCK-type POKéMON…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1051
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_MrBrineyWalksInTheTunnel"
msgid ""
"The old sailor MR. BRINEY lives in\n"
"a cottage by the sea.\p"
"He goes for walks in the tunnel every\n"
"so often.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1057
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_MrBrineyLovesPeeko"
msgid ""
"The old sailor MR. BRINEY lives in\n"
"a cottage by the sea.\p"
"He said he was going shopping in\n"
"SLATEPORT for his pet, PEEKO.\p"
"That old sea dog, he must really love\n"
"that PEEKO.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1065
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_WowYouHavePokemon"
msgid ""
"Wow, you have POKéMON with you, too.\p"
"When I get bigger, I'm going to go\n"
"places with POKéMON, too.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1070
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_CatchRarePokemonIfIGoToSchool"
msgid ""
"POKéMON TRAINER'S SCHOOL!\p"
"If I go to this school, will I be able\n"
"to catch rare POKéMON easily?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1075
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_PokemonCanChangeLookFromExp"
msgid ""
"If a POKéMON gains experience in\n"
"battles, it can sometimes change in\l"
"the way it looks.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1080
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_PokemonChangeShape"
msgid ""
"A POKéMON changes shape?\n"
"If one did that, I would be shocked!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1084
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_TradePokemonGrowFast"
msgid ""
"A POKéMON you get in a trade from\n"
"someone grows fast.\p"
"But if you don't have certain GYM\n"
"BADGES, it may not obey you…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1090
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_OutOfTheWay"
msgid ""
"Get out!\n"
"Out of the way!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1094
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_WaitDontTakeMyGoods"
msgid ""
"Wait! Pleeeaaase!\p"
"Don't take my GOODS!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1098
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_HelpMeIWasRobbed"
msgid ""
"Oh, it's you!\p"
"You're that fantastic TRAINER who\n"
"helped me in PETALBURG WOODS!\p"
"Help me! I was robbed by TEAM AQUA!\n"
"I have to get the DEVON GOODS back!\p"
"If I don't…\n"
"I'm going to be in serious trouble.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1107
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_ShadyCharacterTookOffTowardsTunnel"
msgid ""
"That shady character, I think he took\n"
"off towards the tunnel over there.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1111
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_YouGotItThankYou"
msgid ""
"Oh! How did it go?\n"
"The DEVON GOODS?\p"
"You did!\n"
"You got them back!\p"
"You really are a great TRAINER!\p"
"I know! As my thanks, I'll give you\n"
"another GREAT BALL!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1120
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_YoureLoadedWithItems"
msgid ""
"You're loaded with items.\n"
"I can't give you this GREAT BALL.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1124
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_PleaseComeWithMe"
msgid ""
"Excuse me, please!\n"
"Please come with me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1128
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_MayHiLetsRegister"
msgid ""
"MAY: Oh, hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"You had a MATCH CALL feature put\n"
"on your POKéNAV!\p"
"Let's register each other so we can\n"
"contact one another anytime!\p"
"… … … … … …$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1136
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_RegisteredMay"
msgid ""
"Registered MAY\n"
"in the POKéNAV.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1140
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_MayPassedBrineyWantToBattle"
msgid ""
"MAY: Oh, by the way, I passed\n"
"MR. BRINEY in PETALBURG WOODS.\p"
"I guess he's on his way home to his\n"
"cottage by the sea.\p"
"How's your POKéDEX coming along,\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}? Mine's looking pretty decent!\p"
"So…\n"
"How about a little battle?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1150
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_MayOhHaventRaisedPokemonEnough"
msgid ""
"MAY: Oh, what's the matter?\p"
"Haven't you caught or raised your\n"
"POKéMON very much?\p"
"That's not very good for a TRAINER!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1156
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_MayWantToBattle"
msgid ""
"MAY: So, what do you think?\n"
"How about a little battle here?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1160
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_MayImNotGoingToLose"
msgid ""
"MAY: You just became a TRAINER,\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}. I'm not going to lose!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1164
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_MayDefeat"
msgid ""
"Yikes!\n"
"You're better than I expected!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1168
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_MayMrBrineyHint"
msgid ""
"MAY: Oh, by the way, MR. BRINEY, who\n"
"I just passed…\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, you just moved here so you\n"
"might not know this, but MR. BRINEY\l"
"was once a revered seafarer.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1175
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_BrendanHiLetsRegister"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Oh, hey, {PLAYER}!\p"
"You had a MATCH CALL feature put\n"
"on your POKéNAV! Cool!\p"
"Let's register each other so we can\n"
"get in touch anytime!\p"
"… … … … … …$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1183
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_RegisteredBrendan"
msgid ""
"Registered BRENDAN\n"
"in the POKéNAV.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1187
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_BrendanPassedBrineyWantToBattle"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: By the way, {PLAYER}, I walked\n"
"by MR. BRINEY in PETALBURG WOODS.\p"
"I bet he was on his way home to his\n"
"cottage by the sea.\p"
"{PLAYER}, how's your POKéDEX?\n"
"Have you filled in any pages yet?\p"
"Mine rules.\p"
"Want to have a battle to test how\n"
"far you've progressed?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1198
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_BrendanNoConfidenceInPokemon"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: What's the matter? Don't have\n"
"any confidence in your POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1202
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_BrendanWantToBattle"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: What's up?\n"
"Want to have a battle with me?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1206
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_BrendanIWontGoEasy"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: I know you just became\n"
"a TRAINER, but I won't go easy!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1210
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_BrendanDefeat"
msgid ""
"Hmm…\n"
"You're pretty good.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1214
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_BrendanMrBrineyHint"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: By the way, you know\n"
"MR. BRINEY? The guy I just passed?\p"
"I bet you didn't know this, since you\n"
"just moved here, {PLAYER}, but\l"
"MR. BRINEY was once a great sailor.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1221
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_TunnelNearingCompletion"
msgid ""
"“Timesaving tunnel nearing\n"
"completion!”\p"
"…Is what it says on the sign, but\n"
"there's also a big “X” splashed\l"
"across it in red paint…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1228
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_DevonCorpSign"
msgid ""
"DEVON CORPORATION\p"
"“For all your living needs, we make\n"
"it all.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1233
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_GymSign"
msgid ""
"RUSTBORO CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
"LEADER: ROXANNE\p"
"“The ROCK-loving honors student!”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1238
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_DevonCorpBranchOfficeSign"
msgid ""
"DEVON CORP. BRANCH OFFICE\p"
"“Access limited to DEVON employees\n"
"and authorized personnel.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1243
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_CitySign"
msgid ""
"RUSTBORO CITY\p"
"“The city probing the integration of\n"
"nature and science.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1248
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_TrainersSchoolSign"
msgid ""
"POKéMON TRAINER'S SCHOOL\p"
"“We'll teach you anything about\n"
"POKéMON!”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1253
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_CuttersHouse"
msgid "CUTTER'S HOUSE$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1256
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_DevelopedNewPokenavFeature"
msgid ""
"I've been developing an added feature\n"
"for the POKéNAV…\p"
"And it turned out great!\p"
"{PLAYER}, may I see that POKéNAV?\n"
"The one our PRESIDENT gave you?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1263
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_AddedMatchCallPleaseCallMrStone"
msgid ""
"There you go, {PLAYER}!\p"
"I added a new feature named\n"
"MATCH CALL to your POKéNAV.\p"
"Using the MATCH CALL feature,\n"
"you can chat with people who have\l"
"been registered in your POKéNAV.\p"
"{PLAYER}, our PRESIDENT STONE should\n"
"be registered in your POKéNAV.\p"
"Test it out.\n"
"Please give our PRESIDENT a call.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1275
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_PleaseSelectPokenav"
msgid "Please select the POKéNAV.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1278
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_IdBetterGetBackToWork"
msgid ""
"Okay, I'd better get back to work.\n"
"Please take care, {PLAYER}!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc:1282
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Text_YouCanHave2On2Battle"
msgid ""
"Did you know this?\p"
"You can have a 2-on-2 battle even\n"
"if you're not with another TRAINER.\p"
"If you catch the eyes of two TRAINERS\n"
"when you have two or more POKéMON,\l"
"they'll both challenge you.\p"
"Don't you think it'd be cool if you\n"
"could beat two TRAINERS by yourself?$"
msgstr ""
